's a practical starting point for running a refrigerator, lights, fans, laptops, and other essentials while camping without hookups.\n\n## Top picks with solar panels\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Anker SOLIX C2000 Gen 2 portable power station with 400W folding solar panel product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"4:5\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n(Best overall for RV)\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn654697product1\",\"Anker SOLIX C2000 Gen 2 + 400W Solar Panel\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$1,999.99\n\nAnker SOLIX \u00b7 2,048Wh \u00b7 2,400W AC \u00b7 400W solar kit\n\nParticularly RV-friendly thanks to its TT-30 outlet, efficient standby consumption, and expandable battery.\n\nSold by Ankersolix US\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn654697product2\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"4:5\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn654697product2\",\"EcoFlow Solar Generator DELTA 2 Max with 2PCS TOPCon 160W So\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$1,499.00\n\nEcoFlow \u00b7 2,048Wh \u00b7 2,400W AC \u00b7 320W solar kit\n\nExcellent solar charging flexibility, with up to 1,000W supported solar input and expandable storage.\n\nSold by The Home Depot\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn654697product19\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"4:5\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn654697product19\",\"Jackery Solar Generator 2000 v2 | 2,042Wh 2,200W Power Stati\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$1,399.00\n\nJackery \u00b7 2,042Wh \u00b7 2,200W AC \u00b7 400W solar kit\n\nA lightweight choice for moving the station between your RV, campsite, and home.\n\nSold by Eco Solar Kits\n\nListed prices are from current shopping results and can change. Specifications are based on manufacturer information and recent comparisons. \ue200cite\ue202turn654697search2\ue202turn654697search8\ue201\n\n## How they compare for RV use\n\n| Feature | Anker C2000 Gen 2 | EcoFlow DELTA 2 Max | Jackery 2000 v2 |\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Battery | 2,048Wh | 2,048Wh | 2,042Wh |\n| AC output | 2,400W | 2,400W | 2,200W |\n| Maximum solar input | 800W | 1,000W | 400W |\n| Weight | \\~41 lb | \\~50 lb | \\~39.5 lb |\n| 30A RV outlet | Yes\\* | No | No |\n| Battery expandable |  |  |  |"}],"c":15}       

