\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn654697product19\",\"Jackery Solar Generator 2000 v2 | 2,042Wh 2,200W Power Stati\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$1,399.00\n\nJackery \u00b7 2,042Wh \u00b7 2,200W AC \u00b7 400W solar kit\n\nA lightweight choice for moving the station between your RV, campsite, and home.\n\nSold by Eco Solar Kits\n\nListed prices are from current shopping results and can change. Specifications are based on manufacturer information and recent comparisons. \ue200cite\ue202turn654697search2\ue202turn654697search8\ue201\n\n## How they compare for RV use\n\n| Feature | Anker C2000 Gen 2 | EcoFlow DELTA 2 Max | Jackery 2000 v2 |\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Battery | 2,048Wh | 2,048Wh | 2,042Wh |\n| AC output | 2,400W | 2,400W | 2,200W |\n| Maximum solar input | 800W | 1,000W | 400W |\n| Weight | \\~41 lb | \\~50 lb | \\~39.5 lb |\n| 30A RV outlet | Yes\\* | No | No |\n| Battery expandable | Yes | Yes | No |\n\n\\*The Anker's TT-30 outlet is limited to 2,400W total, not the full 3,600W available from a conventional 30A RV hookup. \ue200cite\ue202turn654697search8\ue202turn654697search2\ue201\n\n## How much solar power do you actually need?"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics/0/code","o":"replace","v":"unterminated_braced_value"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics/0/line","o":"replace","v":65},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics/0/column","o":"replace","v":1},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics/0/directive","o":"add","v":"body"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/appData/opGenui/componentResults/942d2c4a-6ecd-545a-a687-b8420b25b9e3","o":"add","v":{"status":"resolved","state":{"items":[{"url":"https://www.unpluggedwatts.com/2000-watt-power-station-comparison/?utm_source=chatgpt.com","ref_id":"turn654697search8","refs":[{"turn_index":654697,"ref_type":"search","ref_index":8}],"source_label":"UnpluggedWatts","source_name":"Unplugg